OL,3,GNEWSAUnder pressure council 'seeking
OL,4,Asecond bailout'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucester City Council (GCC) is
OL,7,Flooking to seek an additional #8m loan
OL,8,Ffrom the government, the BBC
OL,9,Funderstands.
OL,11,FThe council was awarded #15.5m from the
OL,12,FMinistry of Housing, Communities and
OL,13,FLocal Government (MHCLG) in February
OL,14,Fafter it effectively went bankrupt.
OL,16,FSources have told the BBC council
OL,17,Fleaders revealed plans to ask the
OL,18,Fgovernment for additional help on
OL,19,FThursday, but it is not clear whether
OL,20,Fthis is to cover existing financial
OL,21,Fissues or if new ones have come to
OL,22,Flight.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
